<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1324159296"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1441121857"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="End Of The Night"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Danny Avila"/><amll:meta key="album" value="End Of The Night"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:25.724"><div begin="00:09.485" end="03:22.264"><p begin="00:09.485" end="00:11.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I don't want to come out strange<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想让你觉得奇怪</span></p><p begin="00:11.787" end="00:13.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Excuse the look on my face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原谅我脸上那迫不及待的表情</span></p><p begin="00:13.868" end="00:16.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I'm trying my best to behave<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直尽力克制自己的行为</span></p><p begin="00:19.106" end="00:21.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Is it gonna sound cliche?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听起来是有些老套</span></p><p begin="00:21.331" end="00:23.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I feel like we should be closer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我觉得我们应该靠近一点</span></p><p begin="00:23.801" end="00:26.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Tomorrow I wanna know ya<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天 我想好好了解你</span></p><p begin="00:28.488" end="00:30.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I don't wanna know what you're drinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想知道你喝的是什么</span></p><p begin="00:30.957" end="00:33.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I just wanna know what you're thinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想知道你是怎么想的</span></p><p begin="00:33.287" end="00:35.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:35.671" end="00:37.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:38.125" end="00:40.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I don't wanna start at the beginning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再离开你的怀抱</span></p><p begin="00:40.217" end="00:42.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Show me everything that you're feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我说说你的感受</span></p><p begin="00:42.668" end="00:45.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:45.263" end="00:46.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:46.542" end="00:48.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Fuck all of the small talk<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:48.937" end="00:51.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Give me all the real stuff<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我说点真心话</span></p><p begin="00:51.352" end="00:53.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Let's start at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="00:53.634" end="00:56.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="00:56.240" end="00:58.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Tell me all your secrets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的秘密都告诉我</span></p><p begin="00:58.562" end="01:00.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Kiss me like you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真心实意地吻我</span></p><p begin="01:00.945" end="01:04.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Let's start at the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="01:04.449" end="01:07.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="01:25.940" end="01:28.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Don't know how long I've been waiting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道我等了多久</span></p><p begin="01:28.356" end="01:31.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">For a change my life conversation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才等到今天 也许这次谈话会改变我的一生</span></p><p begin="01:31.216" end="01:33.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Could you change my life?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能改变我的生活吗</span></p><p begin="01:33.737" end="01:35.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Could you do it tonight?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚你愿意这样做吗</span></p><p begin="01:35.600" end="01:37.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Excuse my fucking impatience<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原谅我没什么耐心</span></p><p begin="01:37.786" end="01:40.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'm just trying to get you naked<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很想看看你一丝不挂的样子</span></p><p begin="01:41.083" end="01:42.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Body to mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从身体到心</span></p><p begin="01:43.265" end="01:45.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Your body to mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你的身体和心事都暴露在我面前</span></p><p begin="01:45.512" end="01:47.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I don't wanna know what you're drinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想知道你喝的是什么</span></p><p begin="01:47.837" end="01:49.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I just wanna know what you're thinking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想知道你是怎么想的</span></p><p begin="01:49.947" end="01:52.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="01:52.486" end="01:54.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">At the end of the night, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="01:54.983" end="01:57.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I don't wanna start at the beginning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再离开你的怀抱</span></p><p begin="01:57.036" end="01:59.469" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Show me everything that you're feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我说说你的感受</span></p><p begin="01:59.479" end="02:02.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="02:02.057" end="02:03.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="02:03.322" end="02:05.785" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Fuck all of the small talk<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抛开那些客套话</span></p><p begin="02:05.795" end="02:08.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Give me all the real stuff<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我说点真心话</span></p><p begin="02:08.156" end="02:10.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Let's start at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="02:10.474" end="02:12.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="02:12.916" end="02:15.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Tell me all your secrets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的秘密都告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:15.457" end="02:17.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Kiss me like you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真心实意地吻我</span></p><p begin="02:17.800" end="02:20.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Let's start at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="02:20.029" end="02:22.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">At the end of the night, at the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="02:22.509" end="02:23.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在夜晚结束的时候</span></p><p begin="02:41.941" end="02:44.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Fuck all of the small talk<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抛开那些客套话</span></p><p begin="02:44.193" end="02:46.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">Give me all the real stuff<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我说点真心话</span></p><p begin="02:46.796" end="02:50.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Let's start, yeah, yeah, let's start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="02:51.305" end="02:53.899" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Tell me all your secrets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的秘密都告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:53.909" end="02:56.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Kiss me like you mean it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真心实意地吻我</span></p><p begin="02:56.218" end="03:00.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">Let's start, let's start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span></p><p begin="03:16.345" end="03:17.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在今夜结束时</span></p><p begin="03:17.637" end="03:18.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在今夜结束时</span></p><p begin="03:18.834" end="03:20.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在今夜结束时</span></p><p begin="03:20.068" end="03:22.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">At the end of the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在今夜结束时</span></p></div></body></tt>